<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Vietnamese (vi) for :feature:files. Mirrors values/strings.xml key for key.

  WORDING BAN (LLM.md §1, §5) carries into every locale: no performance, security or memory claim and
  no percentage figure. Every screen here reports BYTES, measured, and says what it could not reach.

  The two rules the English file names hold in this locale too: every count goes through <plurals>,
  and a coverage or truncation statement is never omitted.

  PLURALS — Vietnamese has ONE CLDR plural category, `other`.
-->
